    "text": "<p><math><msub><mrow><mtext>N</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mtext>moles&#160;of&#160;</mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mtext>stoichiometry&#160;of&#160;</mtext><msub><mtext>N</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8800;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>mole&#160;of&#160;</mtext><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mtext>stoichiometry&#160;of&#160;</mtext><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Whose ratio is less called limiting reagent.</p><p><br />(a) mole of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> ratio of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />mole of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> ratio of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />there is no limiting reagent.</p><p><br />(b) mole of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>35</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1.25</mn></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathva